  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Ability to spawn multiple local spot/point/directional lights with options to adjust their brightness, range and color. This would be amazing for creators who like to have more control over lighting during photo shoots. This would also allow people to see better in darker maps if need be. \nOf course this could be implemented with a caveat that map creators can allow or disallow the use of the system of their map similar to how certain mods like noclip/esp/etc. had whitelists regarding which maps they were allowed on.\nI love playing around with lighting and currently have a system similar to this implemented on my Avatar, however the prefab adds 45 lights to it. Would love to not have to do that to my avis in order to have better control over the lighting in my photos.",
